  "english": "The law of honour is that maintained by honourable men. O thou whose locks diffuse the odour of pleasant musk! Behold, especially good is (it to cultivate) that which is esteemed by men of honourable mind; for in this world it is (obviously) good : and, since it leads to perseverance in the way of virtue, it will yield good things in yonder world also.",
